# Session and handoff

- Start: charter + router. Do not open extra skill bodies “just in case”.
- After install/update of this pack: tell the user to open a **new Agent chat**.
- Looping, contradictions, or repeated failed tools: stop features, write `handoff.md` (progress, decisions, next step), recommend a new chat.
- End of large work: journal via `agent-action-journal` only if the work was multi-step; `log-session` if the user wants a distillate.
- Do not keep a polluted context alive by adding more tools.
